    <para id="para-00050">Musa, S. S., Odey, G. O., Musa, M. K., Alhaj, S. M., Sunday, B. A., Muhammad, S. M., &amp; Lucero-Prisno, D. E. (2021). Early marriage and teenage pregnancy: The unspoken consequences of COVID-19 pandemic in Nigeria. <emphasis effect="italics">Public Health in Practice, 2,</emphasis> 100152. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.puhip.2021.100152</para>
